stonedog-tests
Copyright 2026 StoneDogCode L.L.C.

This product collects test inventories from source repositories and renders
them: how many tests each project has, at which tier, in which language. It
contains no test inventories of its own beyond the demo fixtures in `fixtures/`,
which are generated from public repositories in this organisation.

